### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###

### Search user by first_name
GET http://localhost:3000/api/user/Andres
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "first_name": "Andres",
    "last_name": "Perez",
    "phone": "3001234567",
    "email": "andres@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456",
    "id_rol": 1,
    "id_department": 1,
    "id_specialization": 1
}


###

### Delete user by ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/user/7
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###

### Update user
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/user/10
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


{
    "first_name": "Andres",
    "last_name": "Gomez",
    "phone": "3009876543",
    "email": "guti@gmail.com",
    "password": "12345",
    "id_rol": 1,
    "id_departament": 1,
    "id_specialization": 2
}